--- Class features and racial traits (2014 rules) ---

Class features and racial traits in data/dnd5e_srd.json are read from the
Foundry VTT dnd5e system (https://github.com/foundryvtt/dnd5e), specifically
its 2014-rules packs: `classes` (the twelve core classes), `classfeatures` and
`races`. That repository's own terms are MIT for the code and CC-BY-4.0 for the
SRD-derived text; only that content is used, and none of that repository's other
content or assets are bundled here.

This project targets the 2014 rules and does not read Foundry's 2024 packs
(`classes24`, `spells24`, `origins24`, `feats24`), which carry SRD 5.2 material
under the same CC-BY-4.0 terms (SRD 5.2, https://www.dndbeyond.com/srd).

The race list follows the 2014 books and is wider than the SRD 5.1 subset
included in the section above, so a redistributor should confirm their own
obligations for that text rather than relying on the SRD 5.1 grant to cover it.

